
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#081326">
<title>GeoMaster - Aventura Mundial</title>
<style>
:root {
  --bg:#081326; --panel:#12233d; --panel2:#1b3555;
  --mint:#57f2c2; --gold:#ffd166; --text:#f4f7ff;
  --muted:#a8b8d0; --red:#ff647c;
}
* { box-sizing:border-box; }
body {
  margin:0; min-height:100vh;
  background:radial-gradient(ellipse at top,#18385a,var(--bg) 70%);
  color:var(--text); font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}
button { font:inherit; cursor:pointer; }
header {
  display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;
  padding:15px; position:sticky; top:0; z-index:5;
  background:#081326ed; border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff20;
}
.logo { font-size:22px; font-weight:900; }
.logo span { color:var(--mint); }
.xp-pill { padding:10px 13px; border-radius:22px; background:var(--panel); color:var(--gold); font-weight:bold; }
main { max-width:850px; margin:auto; padding:16px; }
.page { display:none; }
.page.active { display:block; }
.banner {
  text-align:center; padding:24px 14px; margin:8px 0 20px;
  border-radius:22px; background:linear-gradient(145deg,#183957,#12233d);
  border:1px solid #ffffff20;
}
.ninja { font-size:65px; }
h1 { font-size:29px; margin:10px 0; }
h2 { font-size:22px; }
p { color:var(--muted); line-height:1.5; }
.mint { color:var(--mint); }
.gold { color:var(--gold); }
.btn {
  display:block; width:100%; border:0; border-radius:12px;
  padding:14px; margin:10px 0; background:var(--mint);
  color:#071629; font-weight:bold;
}
.btn.secondary { background:var(--panel2); color:var(--text); border:1px solid #ffffff20; }
.btn.goldbtn { background:var(--gold); }
.btn:disabled { opacity:.45; cursor:not-allowed; }
.grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:10px; }
.card { background:var(--panel); border:1px solid #ffffff20; padding:14px; border-radius:16px; min-width:0; }
.card h3 { margin:8px 0; }
.card p { font-size:14px; }
.world-icon { font-size:35px; }
.locked { opacity:.5; }
.progress { height:8px; background:#ffffff18; border-radius:9px; overflow:hidden; margin:12px 0; }
.progress div { height:100%; background:var(--mint); }
.stats { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:8px; margin:15px 0; }
.stat { text-align:center; padding:12px 4px; border-radius:12px; background:var(--panel); }
.stat strong { display:block; color:var(--mint); font-size:21px; }
.stat small { color:var(--muted); }
.question-card { background:var(--panel); border-radius:18px; padding:16px; margin-top:12px; }
.meta { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:8px; font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); }
#questionText { font-size:21px; line-height:1.4; }
.answer {
  width:100%; text-align:left; padding:14px; margin:6px 0;
  border:1px solid #ffffff22; border-radius:12px;
  background:var(--panel2); color:var(--text);
}
.answer.correct { background:#15533f; border-color:var(--mint); }
.answer.wrong { background:#642b3b; border-color:var(--red); }
.answer:disabled { cursor:default; }
.feedback { min-height:25px; font-weight:bold; }
.badge { display:inline-block; padding:7px 10px; margin:3px; border-radius:20px; background:#ffffff12; }
footer { text-align:center; padding:20px; color:var(--muted); font-size:12px; }
@media(max-width:420px) {
  main { padding:12px; } .card { padding:11px; }
  h1 { font-size:25px; } #questionText { font-size:19px; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="logo">🌎 Geo<span>Master</span></div>
  <div class="xp-pill">⚡ <span id="xpDisplay">0</span> XP</div>
</header>

<main>
<section id="home" class="page active">
  <div class="banner">
    <div class="ninja">🥷</div>
    <h1>AVENTURA <span class="mint">MUNDIAL</span></h1>
    <p>Explore o planeta, responda perguntas e torne-se um mestre da geografia!</p>
